WEBVTT

00:09:58.356 --> 00:10:02.436
give rise to this experience
of consciousness,

00:10:02.436 --> 00:10:03.596
in your view?

00:10:03.996 --> 00:10:06.396
AS: First, I mean,
consciousness is experience,

00:10:06.436 --> 00:10:09.516
so I'd use the two terms
synonymously there.

00:10:09.556 --> 00:10:12.396
It's the same thing.

00:10:12.436 --> 00:10:13.916
And by the way,

00:10:13.916 --> 00:10:18.476
the idea of your brain wobbling around
in its bony vault of a skull

00:10:18.476 --> 00:10:21.236
is presumably less disturbing
than it doing something else

00:10:21.276 --> 00:10:24.076
and doing something
outside of the skull. (Laughter)

00:10:24.076 --> 00:10:26.196
That would be the more worrying situation.

00:10:26.236 --> 00:10:28.876
But the question, of course,
this is the big question.

00:10:28.916 --> 00:10:31.876
You start off with a simple question,
"How does it all happen?"